bg-card text-card-foreground flex flex-col rounded-xl border shadow-sm w-full p-4 dark:shadow-none gap-3"><h2 class="text-base font-semibold">Questions</h2><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Who uses nebula/ui?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"252 repositories with 100+ stars depend on its packages directly. The most-starred are orbit-hq/console, lumen-labs/studio and kestrel/admin-kit."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Which nebula/ui package is used most?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"@nebula/ui: 214 repositories with 100+ stars and 412,880 downloads a week."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How is this counted?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"From each repository's own package.json files, workspaces included. Lockfiles, forks and example, docs or test folders don't count. We read every repository with 100+ stars once a month."}}]}</script><dl class="flex flex-col gap-3 text-sm"><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><dt class="font-semibold">Who uses nebula/ui?</dt><dd class="text-muted-foreground">252 repositories with 100+ stars depend on its packages directly. The most-starred are orbit-hq/console, lumen-labs/studio and kestrel/admin-kit.</dd></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><dt class="font-semibold">Which nebula/ui package is used most?</dt><dd class="text-muted-foreground">@nebula/ui: 214 repositories with 100+ stars and 412,880 downloads a week.</dd></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><dt class="font-semibold">How is this counted?</dt><dd class="text-muted-foreground">From each repository&#x27;s own package.json files, workspaces included. Lockfiles, forks and example, docs or test folders don&#x27;t count. We read every repository with 100+ stars once a month.</dd></div></dl></div><div data-follow="[{&quot;registry&quot;:&quot;npm&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;@nebula/ui&quot;},{&quot;registry&quot;:&quot;npm&quot;,&quot;name&quot;: